<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson, Washington Mutual.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson, Washington Mutual.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded H.F. Ahmanson and Co and Washington Mutual Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- H.F. Ahmanson gained 3/4 to 36-3/4. Washington Mutual gained 3/4 to 47.</p>
<p>-- The two companies have made competing bids for Great Western Financial Corp.</p>
</text>
